1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,103
Field Aide: voice advice for rainfed farmers
Team Kartik and Amrita | NASA Space Apps 2026
Adapting Farms with NASA Data

2
00:00:03,103 --> 00:00:09,877
1. The app greets the farmer, in Hindi:
“Hello. I will ask you a few questions
about your farm.”

3
00:00:09,877 --> 00:00:16,240
2. It asks one question aloud and reads each picture:
“Which district is your farm in?”

4
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:17,743
3. Then it waits for the farmer's answer,
spoken or touched.

5
00:00:17,743 --> 00:00:22,306
4. It takes the answer and moves on to the next question
(from here in English). Eight questions in all.

6
00:00:22,306 --> 00:00:25,106
5. After the last answer: four ways to use the field through the year,
from 45 years of NASA POWER weather and MODIS satellite data.

7
00:00:25,106 --> 00:00:27,300
Each colour is a crop, black is an empty field.
Every suggestion says what is not checked.

8
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:29,500
Supports, does not replace, local experts.
Next: all of India, more crops, orchards.
